=== {{S|nom|fr}} ===
{{fr-rég|ka.ʁɔt}}
[[File:Carotts (Daucus Carotta).jpg|thumb|Des '''carottes''' [[en pleine terre]] et certaines déracinées. (sens 1)]]
[[File:Starr-070730-7894-Daucus carota subsp sativus-in store-Foodland Pukalani-Maui (24522940419).jpg|thumb|Des '''carottes'''. (sens 2)]]
[[File:Ammi Visnaga (289632722).jpg|thumb|''Ammi Visnaga'' ou '''carotte''' cure dent. (sens 3)]]
