{{fr-rég|ɡi.dɔ̃}}
[[Image:2nd_JAG_Det_guidon_transparent.png|thumb|'''Guidon''' militaire ''(1a)'']]
[[Image:Citylenker.jpg|thumb|'''Guidon''' de bicyclette ''(2)'']]
