# [[snob#fr-adj|Snob]].
#* {{exemple|lang=en|The {{w|'''snob''' effect|lang=en}} is a phenomenon described in microeconomics as a situation where the demand for a certain good by individuals of a higher income level is inversely related to its demand by those of a lower income level.}}

=== {{S|nom|en}} ===
{{en-nom-rég|snɑb|snɔb}}
